---
.title = "Coordinate Io Work with Synchronization Primitives",
.date = "2024-01-01",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

`std.Io.Mutex`, `std.Io.RwLock`, `std.Io.Semaphore`, `std.Io.Event`, and
`std.Io.Queue` provide cancellation-aware coordination and typed
producer-consumer storage. The example shows explicit lock ownership, shared
read locking, permit management, event reset, queue close, and FIFO retrieval.

